OL,3,AMen in court over alleged plot to
OL,4,Atarget Manchester Jewish community
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Iranian men have appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged with terror offences over an
OL,8,Falleged plot to target the Jewish
OL,9,Fcommunity in Manchester with a homemade
OL,10,Fbomb.
OL,12,FRahman Salehi, 34, of Salford, and
OL,13,FSalam Ahmadyan, 36, from Liverpool,
OL,14,Fwere accused at Westminster
OL,15,FMagistrates' Court of preparing to
OL,16,Fcommit an act of terrorism or assisting
OL,17,Fanother to commit an act of terrorism
OL,18,Fon or before 20 September.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
