OL,3,AMen in court over alleged plot to
OL,4,Atarget Manchester Jewish community
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the buildings they are alleged
OL,7,Fto have carried out reconnaissance at
OL,8,Fis the Heaton Park synagogue which was
OL,9,Fattacked on 2 October 2025.
OL,11,FBoth men, who had arrived in the UK by
OL,12,Fsmall boat, were arrested in
OL,13,FManchester's Northern Quarter on the
OL,14,Feve of Yom Kippur - the holiest day in
OL,15,Fthe Jewish calendar.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
